! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! cmavo: da'e (KOhA2)

!!! Proposed definition
A pro-sumti referring to a remote future utterance.

!! See Also
* da'u
* de'e
* de'u
* dei
* di'e
* di'u
* do'i

!! Proposed keywords
* that (to be said much later) - ''Ug. I can't think of anything better, but this is ugly. - mi'e.aionys.''

!!! Usage examples
;ko'a ba tavla do zo'e ti'u lo djedi poi jersi ti .i da'e ba barda spaji:"He'll tell you tomorrow. IT will be a doozy."

!!! Notes

!! cmavo: da'u (KOhA2)

!!! Notes
!!! Proposed definition
A pro-sumti referring to a remote past utterance.

!! See Also
* da'e
* de'e
* de'u
* dei
* di'e
* di'u
* do'i

!! Proposed keywords
* that (said much earlier)

!!! Usage examples
;''insert lojban here'':"She couldn't have known that IT would be true."
!!! Notes

